# Training Pipeline — Deferred Outcome Tracking

## Design Principle
Snapshots are captured immediately when the operator clicks "Train LLM on this snapshot."
Outcomes (WIN/LOSS/NEUTRAL) are recorded 1–5 days later, after price has moved.
Only records WITH outcomes are exported for fine-tuning. This prevents label leakage.

## Data Flow

```
Operator clicks TrainButton
        │
        ▼
POST /training/snapshot
  - Stores full kill chain payload as JSONL line
  - Assigns snapshot_id (UUID)
  - Records regime, direction, confidence, signal_type
  - Registers in pending_outcomes.json index with outcome_due_date (+3 days default)
  - Returns: { snapshot_id, outcome_due_date, complete_records }
        │
        ▼ (3 days later)
GET /training/pending-outcomes
  - Returns overdue[] (past due_date) + upcoming[] (within 2 days)
  - Each entry has: snapshot_id, captured_at, outcome_due, label, regime, direction, days_overdue
  - Frontend polls this every 60s; shows amber badge when overdue_count > 0
        │
        ▼
Operator opens OutcomePanel, enters P&L %, clicks WIN/LOSS/FLAT
        │
        ▼
POST /training/outcome
  - Body: { snapshot_id, outcome: "WIN"|"LOSS"|"NEUTRAL", pnl_pct, days_elapsed }
  - Patches JSONL record in-place (adds outcome, pnl_pct, days_elapsed, outcome_recorded_at)
  - Removes from pending_outcomes.json index
  - Returns: { complete_records }
        │
        ▼
GET /training/export?complete_only=true  (default)
  - Returns only JSONL lines where outcome field is present
  - Download as kill_chain_snapshots_complete.jsonl
  - Export button only appears in UI when complete_records >= 50
```

## File Locations

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `data/training_snapshots.jsonl` | Append-only JSONL, one record per snapshot |
| `data/pending_outcomes.json` | Index of snapshots awaiting outcome recording |

### JSONL Record Schema (complete record)
```json
{
  "snapshot_id": "uuid4",
  "captured_at": "2026-05-23T14:32:00Z",
  "outcome_due_date": "2026-05-26T14:32:00Z",
  "label": "WAR_VETO",
  "regime": "STRONG_DOWNTREND",
  "direction": "BLOCKED",
  "confidence": 87,
  "signal_type": "KILL_CHAIN",
  "symbol": "SPY",
  "note": "Manual label from operator",
  "payload": { ...full KillShotsResponse... },
  "outcome": "WIN",
  "pnl_pct": 1.4,
  "days_elapsed": 3,
  "outcome_recorded_at": "2026-05-26T09:15:00Z"
